        p: "You are setting up a small deployment tool called <code>shipit</code> in your home directory. When you finish, every requirement below must be true. The checklist under the lesson ticks each one off automatically.<br><br>There are no new commands here. Every command you need was taught earlier: <code>mkdir</code>, <code>echo</code> with <code>&gt;</code> and <code>&gt;&gt;</code>, <code>chmod</code>, <code>tar</code>, <code>ln -s</code>, <code>grep -c</code> and <code>cd</code>. The sections below are a <strong>reference card</strong> for each of them, written with throwaway files named <code>demo</code> so they never give away your own work. Each task already spells out the commands, so use this page to understand <em>why</em> they work and what an error message means.",
